      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "LWK are delighted to present 1 Russell Avenue East to the property market.\r\n\r\nNo. 1 Russell Avenue East is a charming two-bedroom, one-bathroom end-of-terrace bungalow, ideally positioned in the heart of the ever-popular East Wall community. This attractive home offers bright and well-proportioned accommodation throughout, together with a spacious rear yard and the added benefit of rear gated laneway access.\r\n\r\nOn entering the property, a warm and inviting entrance hallway welcomes you into the home. The accommodation comprises a bright living room, providing a comfortable and relaxing space for everyday living, and a fully fitted kitchen with ample room for cooking and dining.\r\n\r\nThere are two generously sized double bedrooms, both benefiting from excellent proportions and ample storage space. A family bathroom completes the internal accommodation.\r\n\r\nTo the rear, the property enjoys a spacious private yard, ideal for outdoor dining, entertaining or simply enjoying some outdoor space. The rear gated access to the laneway provides additional convenience. On-street parking is available to the front of the property.\r\n\r\nThe location is another significant attraction. East Wall is a vibrant and well-established residential neighbourhood, offering a strong sense of community while being exceptionally convenient to Dublin City Centre, the IFSC, Docklands and East Point Business Park. A wide range of local shops, cafés, supermarkets and everyday\r\namenities are within easy reach, including Lidl and ALDI on East Wall Road. The area is also well served by schools, recreational facilities and community amenities, including the Sean O'Casey Community Centre and East Wall Recreation Centre.\r\n\r\nFor commuters, the property benefits from excellent transport links, with regular bus services nearby and convenient access to the city centre, Connolly Station and the wider Docklands area. Fairview Park and Clontarf seafront are also within easy reach, offering excellent opportunities for walking, recreation and outdoor activities.\r\nCombining a highly convenient location with comfortable accommodation and valuable outdoor space, No. 1 Russell Avenue represents an excellent opportunity for first-time buyers, downsizers and investors alike. \r\n\r\n***All information provided is to the best of our knowledge. The utmost of care and attention has been placed on providing factual and correct information. In certain cases some information may have been provided by the vendor to us. We do not hold any responsibility for mistakes, errors or inaccuracies in our online advertising and give each and every viewer the right to get an opinion on any concern they may have***"
      },
